Key Takeaway

Azure’s architectural components provide the foundation for scalable, resilient, and manageable cloud environments. Understanding datacenters, regions, availability zones, subscriptions, resource groups, and management groups is essential for designing and administering enterprise cloud infrastructure in Microsoft Azure.
